Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 15:09:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] W1-04 Runtime Diagnostics: GC analysis

Event-level GC analysis: registers GarbageCollectionNotificationInfo listener once per collector, keeps a ring of the last 16 events (action/cause/heap-before-after), reports avg reclaimed and dominant cause alongside MXBean totals.
---
 .../diagnostics/GcAnalysisDiagnostic.java     | 140 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 140 insertions(+)
